    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Comparatives",
     "texto": [
      "To compare, use **lebih + adjective + daripada**: **lebih sejuk daripada** means \"cooler than\". **Daripada** marks the second item in the comparison."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Superlative",
     "texto": [
      "**Paling + adjective** means \"the most\": **paling nyaman**, \"the most pleasant\". Indonesian adjectives don't change to agree with the noun."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
